  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dayton Project BiH - The Dayton Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Dayton projektet BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Dayton Project har till syfte att arbeta fram f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar i landets konstitution s&#xe5; att landet kan ans&#xf6;ka om medlemskap i EU. Avsikten &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; att bidra till en bredare diskussion i Bosnien och Hercegovina (BiH) under krigs&#xe5;ren 1991-1995. Denna process kommer att involvera all viktiga politiska och civila intressgrupper i BiH och st&#xf6;ds av det internationella samfundet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dayton Project has as a goal to work towards improving Croatia&apos;s constitution so that the country can apply for membership in the EU. The goal is also to contribute to a broader discussion in Bosnia and Hercegovina (BiH) regarding the war years 1991-1995. This process will involve all the key political actors and civil society in BiH and is supported by the international community.</narrative>
  </description>
